  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Living Conditions for Displacement-Affected Populations in Gaza</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project supports displacement-affected populations in Gaza through two complementary components: (1) the distribution of emergency shelter and non-food items (SNFIs) through IOM&apos;s Common Pipeline; and (2) cash-for-work assistance to enable urgent shelter repairs and strengthen winterization preparedness.</narrative>
  </description>
